{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-028",
    "title": "一纸封天令"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_151",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "没有一方愿意承担回川城的代价，却都承认这是共同决定。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "石室门环在顾长离手中微微发热。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4821,
          "end": 4821
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有立即推门，先把铜针插进门缝。针尖触到某种坚硬的东西，发出一声细响。门内念名单的声音已经停止，只有火焰燃烧的噼啪声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4823,
          "end": 4823
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人在里面。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4825,
          "end": 4825
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“被删去的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4841,
          "end": 4841
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有我叔父吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4843,
          "end": 4843
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4845,
          "end": 4845
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4847,
          "end": 4847
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬手，将无相铜镜翻过来。镜面没有倒影，只有一圈缓慢旋转的灰雾。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4849,
          "end": 4849
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他不在名单里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4851,
          "end": 4851
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临皱眉：“他不是被删去的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4853,
          "end": 4853
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他是主动留下的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4855,
          "end": 4855
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留下和被删有什么区别？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4857,
          "end": 4857
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“被删的人失去名字，留下的人失去回来的资格。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4859,
          "end": 4859
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的债契黑纹已经爬到肩头。她按住伤处，问：“镜子能让我们看见什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4861,
          "end": 4861
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们各自被拿走的部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4863,
          "end": 4863
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“代价？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4865,
          "end": 4865
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看见之后，记忆会重新选择归属。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4867,
          "end": 4867
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜从石室后方走出，肩上的剑伤已经结痂。他把一张被撕开的路线图放在桌上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4869,
          "end": 4869
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗追兵被我引向北门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4871,
          "end": 4871
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看他：“你为什么回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4873,
          "end": 4873
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我答应带你们进城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4875,
          "end": 4875
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你差点死在外面。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4877,
          "end": 4877
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“盟约还没结束。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4879,
          "end": 4879
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向三人：“谁先照镜？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4881,
          "end": 4881
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手：“我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4883,
          "end": 4883
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他把无相铜镜立在面前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4885,
          "end": 4885
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜面灰雾散开，出现一间北河城的旧屋。年幼的陆照临坐在床边，陆沉舟将一盏空灯放在他膝上。屋外有人争吵，声音断断续续，只能听见“太虚”“封存”“不能留下”几个词。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4887,
          "end": 4887
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟蹲在他面前：“如果我不回来，你就去玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4889,
          "end": 4889
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4891,
          "end": 4891
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为那里有人记得我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4893,
          "end": 4893
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4895,
          "end": 4895
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟没有回答。他将灰白石片按进陆照临胸口，石片化作青光，融入心脉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4897,
          "end": 4897
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "年幼的陆照临疼得哭出声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4899,
          "end": 4899
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋站在门外，手里提着第三盏灯。她没有进屋，只把灯放在门槛上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4901,
          "end": 4901
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜面忽然裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4903,
          "end": 4903
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临退后一步，胸口剧痛。一个陌生名字从他舌尖滑出：“沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4905,
          "end": 4905
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见了什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4907,
          "end": 4907
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她在我父亲离开前见过他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4909,
          "end": 4909
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4911,
          "end": 4911
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4913,
          "end": 4913
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻把镜面转向顾长离：“轮到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4915,
          "end": 4915
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离咬牙坐下。镜中先出现一座顾氏祠堂，年轻的顾长离站在门外，听见族老宣读债契。她的叔父跪在堂中，面前放着第二盏灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4917,
          "end": 4917
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "族老说：“顾氏欠灵脉一盏灯，欠玄霄宗三名经手人，欠后代一条命。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4919,
          "end": 4919
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叔父抬头：“账不能这样记。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4921,
          "end": 4921
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "族老把铜环按在他额头：“那就把你的名字记进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4923,
          "end": 4923
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叔父抢走第二盏灯，冲出祠堂。年幼的顾长离追到门口，看见他回头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4925,
          "end": 4925
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别跟来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4927,
          "end": 4927
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜中顾长离没有停下。她追着叔父跑到雪地，直到一扇青铜门前。门内伸出无脸的手，将叔父的脸从影子里抹去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4929,
          "end": 4929
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离猛地睁眼，额头全是冷汗。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4931,
          "end": 4931
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他不是被选中的。”她说，“他是自己替别人进去的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4933,
          "end": 4933
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻点头：“所以债契落到你身上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4935,
          "end": 4935
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我可以把债还回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4937,
          "end": 4937
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要把谁的名字还回去？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4939,
          "end": 4939
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4941,
          "end": 4941
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拿起无相铜镜：“我来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4943,
          "end": 4943
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那张脸与叶观澜相似，却显得更年轻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4951,
          "end": 4951
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯在。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-104",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5027,
          "end": 5027
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临在街巷中继续查访，先听老人讲旧事，再听孩子说眼前的变化。他把每一份证词写下，却不急着判断真假。有人认为灯应由宗门掌管，有人认为城里每个人都有守灯的资格，也有人只想让家人平安回家。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-105",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5029,
          "end": 5029
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "留给后人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-106",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5031,
          "end": 5031
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5041,
          "end": 5041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在只剩一张桌子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5043,
          "end": 5043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "桌子确实还在，桌面嵌着一块黑色石板。石板中央有一道圆形凹槽，凹槽边缘刻着三方印记。顾长离把顾氏旧印按上去，石板立刻亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5045,
          "end": 5045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令。”慧闻的声音从屋外传来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5047,
          "end": 5047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他踏雪进寺，手里捧着无相铜镜。镜面结着霜，却能照出石板上的字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5049,
          "end": 5049
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉异动期间，玄霄宗、归墟盟、无相寺暂止争夺；持印者不得开启天门；任何一方不得独自改写记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5051,
          "end": 5051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方代表随后依次落签：玄霄宗以白玉令画押，归墟盟以刀锋割掌，无相寺以经文盖印。没有一方愿意承担回川城的代价，却都承认这是共同决定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5053,
          "end": 5053
        }
      }
    ],
